#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 0439:06F3"
msgid "You have somehow managed to defeat or evade the first guardians of the Obsidian Fortress, mortal. And now, you have shown an inkling of wisdom in not attempting to attack me. Perhaps you are worthy...* Perhaps not.*Regardless, in reward, I will assist you now by giving you access to the rest of the fortress and offering the use of my pentacle and sundry items you might need in preparing spells. "
msgstr ""

